# flickos-layouts 1.53: check tests the panel's contrast as the style is
# drawn; greybird-gtk-theme and tango-icon-theme: the GTK theme and icons
# Experience names (5.4 MB and 11.6 MB).
Depends: flickos-layouts (>= 1.53),
         greybird-gtk-theme,
         tango-icon-theme,
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: Experience style for the FlickOS desktop
 A bright style for FlickOS in the colors of the early 2000s: deep blue
 title bars with glossy rounded buttons and a red close button, windows in
 Greybird's light grey with the Tango icons, a black console, pale yellow
 notifications, and a green hill under a blue sky with FlickOS's halo.
 .
 Its layout has one blue panel at the bottom: a green Start button, the
 window list, and a lighter blue notification area with the clock.
 .
 Installing it adds Experience to Desktop Layout & Style; Software's Use
 sets the style and the layout together.
